# Example secret contract for the skills-hub deployment (SPEC-014 R-3).
# Copy to runtime-secrets.env (never committed) and replace the placeholders,
# or run shared/platform-ops/gitops/sync-skills-secrets.sh which generates one
# shared query secret and writes every runtime-secrets.env file. Sync into
# the cluster as the optional Secret 'skills-hub-runtime-secrets' referenced
# by the skills-hub deployment.
#
# SKILLS_QUERY_CLIENTS registers the callers permitted to query skills.
# Format: comma-separated entries of client_id=client_secret. Each caller's
# GATEWAY_SKILLS_CLIENT_SECRET must match the secret registered here for its
# client id.
SKILLS_QUERY_CLIENTS=tool-gateway=replace-with-shared-skills-query-secret
